      "title": "A later comparative witness",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block_4",
          "text": "A 407 BCE petition from Judeans at Elephantine to Bagohi, governor of Judah, offers later comparative evidence for Persian provincial administration, priestly authority, and written appeals. It helps illuminate the administrative world around Ezra-Nehemiah, but it is not direct evidence for every detail of Nehemiah 2.",
          "verse_refs": [
            "Nehemiah 2:1-20"
          ],
          "evidence_ids": [
